{"format":1,"kind":"spi","name":"lis3dh_fifo","label":"ST LIS3DH: 3-axis accelerometer with FIFO (SPI)","description":"The LIS3DH read through its 32-sample FIFO (CTRL_REG5 FIFO_EN, FIFO_CTRL_REG mode FIFO or\nstream): samples arrive at the output data rate, and every read of OUT_X_L pops the next byte,\nso a 6-byte burst from OUT_X_L is one X, Y, Z sample, as on the part. FIFO_SRC_REG reports the\nlevel (FSS), EMPTY, OVRN_FIFO and the watermark (WTM against FTH). The data format follows\nCTRL_REG1 and CTRL_REG4 as in `lis3dh`; OUT_X_H to OUT_Z_H read the current sample directly.\n\nLimits: a full FIFO drops its oldest sample in both modes (the part stops in FIFO mode and\ndrops the oldest in stream mode). With the FIFO off, OUT_X_L reads 0 and a burst from it\nstays at OUT_X_L: for direct reads use `lis3dh`. The pod runs one FIFO sensor at a time.\n","datasheet":"https://www.st.com/en/mems-and-sensors/lis3dh.html","version":"1.0.0","license":"Apache-2.0","params":[{"key":"accel_x_g","unit":"g","min":-16,"max":16,"default":0,"label":"X"},{"key":"accel_y_g","unit":"g","min":-16,"max":16,"default":0,"label":"Y"},{"key":"accel_z_g","unit":"g","min":-16,"max":16,"default":1,"label":"Z"}],"spi":{"mode":3,"read_bit":{"bit":7,"value":1},"increment_bit":{"bit":6,"value":1},"address_mask":63},"functions":{"sample":{"args":["g","en"],"let":[{"v":"clamp(round(g * 1000 / sens), -(1 << (nbits - 1)), (1 << (nbits - 1)) - 1)"}],"return":"on && en ? v << (16 - nbits) : 0"},"out":{"args":["w","n"],"return":"ble ? byte(w, 1 - n) : byte(w, n)"}},"let":[{"odr":"bits(reg[0x20], 7, 4)"},{"lp":"bit(reg[0x20], 3)"},{"hr":"bit(reg[0x23], 3) && !lp"},{"fs":"bits(reg[0x23], 5, 4)"},{"ble":"bit(reg[0x23], 6)"},{"on":"odr != 0 && odr <= 9"},{"nbits":"lp ? 8 : hr ? 12 : 10"},{"sens":"lp ? [16, 32, 64, 192][fs] : hr ? [1, 2, 4, 12][fs] : [4, 8, 16, 48][fs]"},{"wx":"sample(accel_x_g, bit(reg[0x20], 0))"},{"wy":"sample(accel_y_g, bit(reg[0x20], 1))"},{"wz":"sample(accel_z_g, bit(reg[0x20], 2))"},{"fifo_on":"bit(reg[0x24], 6) && bits(reg[0x2E], 7, 6) != 0"},{"fth":"bits(reg[0x2E], 4, 0)"}],"registers":[{"at":7,"u8":0,"name":"STATUS_REG_AUX"},{"at":15,"u8":51,"name":"WHO_AM_I","writable":false},{"at":30,"u8":16,"name":"CTRL_REG0"},{"at":31,"u8":0,"name":"TEMP_CFG_REG"},{"at":32,"u8":7,"name":"CTRL_REG1"},{"at":33,"u8":0,"name":"CTRL_REG2"},{"at":34,"u8":0,"name":"CTRL_REG3"},{"at":35,"u8":0,"name":"CTRL_REG4"},{"at":36,"u8":0,"name":"CTRL_REG5"},{"at":37,"u8":0,"name":"CTRL_REG6"},{"at":38,"u8":0,"name":"REFERENCE"},{"at":39,"u8":"on ? 0x0F : 0x00","name":"STATUS_REG"},{"at":40,"name":"OUT_X_L","bytes":["out(wx, 0)","out(wx, 1)","out(wy, 0)","out(wy, 1)","out(wz, 0)","out(wz, 1)"]},{"at":46,"u8":0,"name":"FIFO_CTRL_REG"},{"at":47,"name":"FIFO_SRC_REG","u8":"(fifo_level > fth ? 0x80 : 0) | (fifo_level >= 32 ? 0x40 : 0) | (fifo_level == 0 ? 0x20 : 0) | min(fifo_level, 31)","writable":false}],"fifo":{"at":40,"depth":32,"frame":["out(wx, 0)","out(wx, 1)","out(wy, 0)","out(wy, 1)","out(wz, 0)","out(wz, 1)"],"rate_hz":"on ? [0, 1, 10, 25, 50, 100, 200, 400, lp ? 1600 : 0, lp ? 5376 : 1344][odr] : 0","enabled":"fifo_on","overflow":"drop_oldest"}}
